{"id":"vol8-03","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-03/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":445.01,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":3.04,"text":"Now turn to section 3 on page 5.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.28],["turn",0.28,0.62],["to",0.62,0.8],["section",0.8,1.08],["3",1.08,1.62],["on",1.62,2.14],["page",2.14,2.42],["5.",2.42,3.04]]},{"start":5.62,"end":6.38,"text":"Section 3.","words":[["Section",5.62,5.82],["3.",5.82,6.38]]},{"start":7.6,"end":10.98,"text":"You will hear two students called Sylvia and Greg","words":[["You",7.6,7.68],["will",7.68,7.84],["hear",7.84,8.06],["two",8.06,8.44],["students",8.44,9.08],["called",9.08,9.58],["Sylvia",9.58,10.24],["and",10.24,10.64],["Greg",10.64,10.98]]},{"start":11.6,"end":14.86,"text":"discussing their project on renewable energy.","words":[["discussing",11.6,12.12],["their",12.12,12.54],["project",12.54,13.1],["on",13.1,13.6],["renewable",13.6,14.1],["energy.",14.1,14.86]]},{"start":15.84,"end":22.52,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 21 to 25 on page 5.","words":[["First,",15.84,16.38],["you",16.88,17.1],["have",17.1,17.3],["some",17.3,17.48],["time",17.48,17.82],["to",17.82,18.0],["look",18.0,18.14],["at",18.14,18.28],["questions",18.28,18.6],["21",18.6,19.42],["to",19.42,19.64],["25",19.64,20.42],["on",20.42,21.5],["page",21.5,21.84],["5.",21.84,22.52]]},{"start":47.81,"end":52.39,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 25.","words":[["Now",47.81,48.11],["listen",48.11,48.41],["carefully",48.41,48.91],["and",48.91,49.71],["answer",49.71,50.07],["questions",50.07,50.47],["21",50.47,51.45],["to",51.45,51.73],["25.",51.73,52.39]]},{"start":55.91,"end":62.51,"text":"Greg, about this project on renewable energy, we've got to look at some products that use","words":[["Greg,",55.91,56.55],["about",56.89,57.33],["this",57.33,57.65],["project",57.65,58.19],["on",58.19,58.47],["renewable",58.47,58.81],["energy,",58.81,59.39],["we've",59.91,60.51],["got",60.51,60.73],["to",60.73,60.97],["look",60.97,61.09],["at",61.09,61.23],["some",61.23,61.39],["products",61.39,61.77],["that",61.77,62.11],["use",62.11,62.51]]},{"start":62.51,"end":66.31,"text":"it and then see how aware people are of this kind of energy.","words":[["it",62.51,62.81],["and",62.81,63.35],["then",63.35,63.55],["see",63.55,63.83],["how",63.83,64.11],["aware",64.11,64.49],["people",64.49,64.93],["are",64.93,65.21],["of",65.21,65.35],["this",65.35,65.53],["kind",65.53,65.81],["of",65.81,65.93],["energy.",65.93,66.31]]},{"start":66.87,"end":70.81,"text":"Well, first we must clarify what renewable energy is.","words":[["Well,",66.87,67.27],["first",67.59,68.07],["we",68.07,68.41],["must",68.41,68.57],["clarify",68.57,69.05],["what",69.05,69.45],["renewable",69.45,69.83],["energy",69.83,70.37],["is.",70.37,70.81]]},{"start":71.05,"end":71.77,"text":"I've done that.","words":[["I've",71.05,71.31],["done",71.31,71.49],["that.",71.49,71.77]]},{"start":72.39,"end":78.29,"text":"It's energy from a source which is replaced by a natural process such as wind, tidal energy","words":[["It's",72.39,72.61],["energy",72.61,73.01],["from",73.01,73.31],["a",73.31,73.49],["source",73.49,73.81],["which",73.81,74.15],["is",74.15,74.29],["replaced",74.29,74.71],["by",74.71,75.11],["a",75.11,75.33],["natural",75.33,75.63],["process",75.63,76.31],["such",76.31,76.75],["as",76.75,76.93],["wind,",76.93,77.33],["tidal",77.57,77.95],["energy",77.95,78.29]]},{"start":78.29,"end":81.33,"text":"from the sea, energy from the sun, and so on.","words":[["from",78.29,78.61],["the",78.61,78.75],["sea,",78.75,79.07],["energy",79.57,79.89],["from",79.89,80.17],["the",80.17,80.33],["sun,",80.33,80.59],["and",80.59,80.75],["so",80.75,81.07],["on.",81.07,81.33]]},{"start":81.33,"end":86.09,"text":"And I found some very interesting examples of products using these sources.","words":[["And",81.33,82.09],["I",82.09,82.25],["found",82.25,82.53],["some",82.53,82.69],["very",82.69,82.95],["interesting",82.95,83.51],["examples",83.51,83.99],["of",83.99,84.41],["products",84.41,84.87],["using",84.87,85.35],["these",85.35,85.65],["sources.",85.65,86.09]]},{"start":86.53,"end":88.87,"text":"So have I. What have you got?","words":[["So",86.53,87.05],["have",87.05,87.25],["I.",87.25,87.39],["What",88.01,88.33],["have",88.33,88.55],["you",88.55,88.69],["got?",88.69,88.87]]},{"start":89.31,"end":95.81,"text":"Well, the first one is a company in Germany which is producing huge kites that pull ships along.","words":[["Well,",89.31,89.51],["the",89.99,90.25],["first",90.25,90.61],["one",90.61,90.91],["is",90.91,91.19],["a",91.19,91.35],["company",91.35,91.63],["in",91.63,91.85],["Germany",91.85,92.17],["which",92.17,92.67],["is",92.67,92.83],["producing",92.83,93.29],["huge",93.29,93.95],["kites",93.95,94.55],["that",94.55,94.91],["pull",94.91,95.17],["ships",95.17,95.47],["along.",95.47,95.81]]},{"start":96.53,"end":101.89,"text":"The kites are attached by long cables and they fly up to 500 meters above the sea.","words":[["The",96.53,96.69],["kites",96.69,97.03],["are",97.03,97.19],["attached",97.19,97.57],["by",97.57,97.81],["long",97.81,98.21],["cables",98.21,98.77],["and",98.77,99.47],["they",99.47,99.59],["fly",99.59,99.85],["up",99.85,100.05],["to",100.05,100.21],["500",100.21,100.59],["meters",100.59,101.03],["above",101.03,101.37],["the",101.37,101.57],["sea.",101.57,101.89]]},{"start":102.39,"end":103.95,"text":"They must be pretty big.","words":[["They",102.39,102.99],["must",102.99,103.19],["be",103.19,103.39],["pretty",103.39,103.63],["big.",103.63,103.95]]},{"start":104.21,"end":108.15,"text":"And it means that they can be powered by the wind no matter what the weather.","words":[["And",104.21,104.57],["it",104.57,104.75],["means",104.75,105.09],["that",105.09,105.41],["they",105.41,105.57],["can",105.57,105.73],["be",105.73,105.87],["powered",105.87,106.17],["by",106.17,106.43],["the",106.43,106.57],["wind",106.57,106.87],["no",106.87,107.19],["matter",107.19,107.39],["what",107.39,107.71],["the",107.71,107.93],["weather.",107.93,108.15]]},{"start":108.75,"end":110.01,"text":"That sounds like a good idea.","words":[["That",108.75,108.97],["sounds",108.97,109.19],["like",109.19,109.41],["a",109.41,109.53],["good",109.53,109.67],["idea.",109.67,110.01]]},{"start":110.01,"end":113.51,"text":"But will they really help reduce energy use?","words":[["But",110.01,110.99],["will",110.99,111.43],["they",111.43,111.63],["really",111.63,111.97],["help",111.97,112.27],["reduce",112.27,112.69],["energy",112.69,113.11],["use?",113.11,113.51]]},{"start":113.67,"end":119.59,"text":"No, but as well as that, apparently the shipping industry is one of the worst polluters on the","words":[["No,",113.67,113.83],["but",113.97,114.17],["as",114.17,115.01],["well",115.01,115.25],["as",115.25,115.39],["that,",115.39,115.65],["apparently",115.99,116.47],["the",116.47,117.01],["shipping",117.01,117.25],["industry",117.25,117.79],["is",117.79,117.99],["one",117.99,118.17],["of",118.17,118.29],["the",118.29,118.39],["worst",118.39,118.71],["polluters",118.71,119.29],["on",119.29,119.47],["the",119.47,119.59]]},{"start":119.59,"end":124.21,"text":"planet as they use cheap diesel fuel which has terrible toxic emissions.","words":[["planet",119.59,120.05],["as",120.05,120.53],["they",120.53,120.69],["use",120.69,120.95],["cheap",120.95,121.25],["diesel",121.25,121.71],["fuel",121.71,122.07],["which",122.07,122.39],["has",122.39,122.59],["terrible",122.59,123.13],["toxic",123.13,123.65],["emissions.",123.65,124.21]]},{"start":124.93,"end":130.93,"text":"The company believes these kites could cut the use of these fuels by 50% and reduce the","words":[["The",124.93,125.09],["company",125.09,125.43],["believes",125.43,125.91],["these",125.91,126.21],["kites",126.21,126.83],["could",126.83,127.11],["cut",127.11,127.39],["the",127.39,127.59],["use",127.59,127.83],["of",127.83,127.99],["these",127.99,128.17],["fuels",128.17,128.51],["by",128.51,128.77],["50",128.77,129.21],["%",129.21,129.63],["and",129.63,130.37],["reduce",130.37,130.69],["the",130.69,130.93]]},{"start":130.93,"end":132.27,"text":"emissions by the same amount.","words":[["emissions",130.93,131.27],["by",131.27,131.57],["the",131.57,131.71],["same",131.71,131.91],["amount.",131.91,132.27]]},{"start":132.75,"end":133.41,"text":"Sounds good.","words":[["Sounds",132.75,133.05],["good.",133.05,133.41]]},{"start":134.21,"end":138.43,"text":"And I found a company in the US which is developing a new type of car.","words":[["And",134.21,134.73],["I",134.73,134.95],["found",134.95,135.17],["a",135.17,135.31],["company",135.31,135.63],["in",135.63,135.81],["the",135.81,135.91],["US",135.91,136.23],["which",136.23,136.67],["is",136.67,136.91],["developing",136.91,137.29],["a",137.29,137.51],["new",137.51,137.67],["type",137.67,137.93],["of",137.93,138.07],["car.",138.07,138.43]]},{"start":138.43,"end":143.35,"text":"Apparently, they're producing a sports car which doesn't use petrol at all.","words":[["Apparently,",138.43,139.51],["they're",140.01,140.27],["producing",140.27,140.59],["a",140.59,140.81],["sports",140.81,141.17],["car",141.17,141.57],["which",141.57,141.83],["doesn't",141.83,142.23],["use",142.23,142.41],["petrol",142.41,142.81],["at",142.81,143.05],["all.",143.05,143.35]]},{"start":143.87,"end":146.91,"text":"Just electricity, but for the US market only.","words":[["Just",143.87,144.01],["electricity,",144.01,144.55],["but",145.13,145.45],["for",145.45,145.73],["the",145.73,145.83],["US",145.83,146.19],["market",146.19,146.57],["only.",146.57,146.91]]},{"start":147.31,"end":148.11,"text":"Sounds intriguing.","words":[["Sounds",147.31,147.59],["intriguing.",147.59,148.11]]},{"start":148.83,"end":150.27,"text":"Do we know what it'll look like?","words":[["Do",148.83,149.03],["we",149.03,149.17],["know",149.17,149.33],["what",149.33,149.53],["it'll",149.53,149.77],["look",149.77,149.99],["like?",149.99,150.27]]},{"start":150.83,"end":156.03,"text":"They're very secretive about it, and all they say is that it won't look ugly, and","words":[["They're",150.83,151.15],["very",151.15,151.31],["secretive",151.31,151.95],["about",151.95,152.15],["it,",152.15,152.37],["and",152.71,152.93],["all",152.93,153.29],["they",153.29,153.51],["say",153.51,153.85],["is",153.85,154.15],["that",154.15,154.39],["it",154.39,154.49],["won't",154.49,154.77],["look",154.77,154.99],["ugly,",154.99,155.29],["and",155.59,156.03]]},{"start":156.03,"end":157.35,"text":"it'll have zero emissions.","words":[["it'll",156.03,156.37],["have",156.37,156.57],["zero",156.57,156.91],["emissions.",156.91,157.35]]},{"start":157.81,"end":158.23,"text":"Wow.","words":[["Wow.",157.81,158.23]]},{"start":158.57,"end":159.03,"text":"Really?","words":[["Really?",158.57,159.03]]},{"start":159.35,"end":160.29,"text":"So they say.","words":[["So",159.35,159.79],["they",159.79,159.99],["say.",159.99,160.29]]},{"start":160.71,"end":161.67,"text":"Any other products?","words":[["Any",160.71,161.05],["other",161.05,161.29],["products?",161.29,161.67]]},{"start":162.29,"end":167.53,"text":"I found an interesting article about a man in South Africa who's selling stoves","words":[["I",162.29,162.61],["found",162.61,163.61],["an",163.61,163.81],["interesting",163.81,164.11],["article",164.11,164.49],["about",164.49,164.83],["a",164.83,165.09],["man",165.09,165.23],["in",165.23,165.39],["South",165.39,165.63],["Africa",165.63,166.03],["who's",166.03,166.63],["selling",166.63,166.85],["stoves",166.85,167.53]]},{"start":167.53,"end":169.53,"text":"using ethanol to the local people.","words":[["using",167.53,168.13],["ethanol",168.13,168.65],["to",168.65,168.85],["the",168.85,168.95],["local",168.95,169.13],["people.",169.13,169.53]]},{"start":169.93,"end":170.45,"text":"Ethanol?","words":[["Ethanol?",169.93,170.45]]},{"start":170.69,"end":170.95,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",170.69,170.95]]},{"start":171.49,"end":173.75,"text":"It's made from the sugar of certain crops.","words":[["It's",171.49,171.89],["made",171.89,172.11],["from",172.11,172.33],["the",172.33,172.47],["sugar",172.47,172.75],["of",172.75,172.97],["certain",172.97,173.27],["crops.",173.27,173.75]]},{"start":174.41,"end":177.21,"text":"Most of the local people use paraffin stoves at the moment,","words":[["Most",174.41,174.71],["of",174.71,174.87],["the",174.87,174.95],["local",174.95,175.15],["people",175.15,175.45],["use",175.45,175.75],["paraffin",175.75,176.27],["stoves",176.27,176.69],["at",176.69,176.83],["the",176.83,176.91],["moment,",176.91,177.21]]},{"start":177.55,"end":180.81,"text":"and they are dangerous because they can explode quite easily.","words":[["and",177.55,177.95],["they",177.95,178.15],["are",178.15,178.25],["dangerous",178.25,178.73],["because",178.73,179.27],["they",179.27,179.55],["can",179.55,179.67],["explode",179.67,180.11],["quite",180.11,180.43],["easily.",180.43,180.81]]},{"start":181.75,"end":182.23,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",181.75,182.23]]},{"start":182.93,"end":185.53,"text":"Now for the next part we have to do a survey","words":[["Now",182.93,183.35],["for",183.35,183.57],["the",183.57,183.69],["next",183.69,183.87],["part",183.87,184.21],["we",184.21,184.45],["have",184.45,184.69],["to",184.69,184.83],["do",184.83,185.01],["a",185.01,185.13],["survey",185.13,185.53]]},{"start":185.53,"end":189.35,"text":"to find out how aware the public is about this kind of energy.","words":[["to",185.53,185.79],["find",185.79,186.03],["out",186.03,186.23],["how",186.23,186.53],["aware",186.53,187.03],["the",187.03,187.29],["public",187.29,187.57],["is",187.57,188.07],["about",188.07,188.37],["this",188.37,188.63],["kind",188.63,188.89],["of",188.89,189.03],["energy.",189.03,189.35]]},{"start":190.05,"end":191.95,"text":"Who shall we approach? Local businesses?","words":[["Who",190.05,190.27],["shall",190.27,190.43],["we",190.43,190.57],["approach?",190.57,190.93],["Local",191.43,191.57],["businesses?",191.57,191.95]]},{"start":192.77,"end":195.71,"text":"I think it's easier to do a survey of the general public","words":[["I",192.77,193.03],["think",193.03,193.23],["it's",193.23,193.49],["easier",193.49,193.83],["to",193.83,193.97],["do",193.97,194.11],["a",194.11,194.23],["survey",194.23,194.69],["of",194.69,194.83],["the",194.83,194.93],["general",194.93,195.21],["public",195.21,195.71]]},{"start":195.71,"end":197.23,"text":"rather than local companies.","words":[["rather",195.71,196.11],["than",196.11,196.45],["local",196.45,196.69],["companies.",196.69,197.23]]},{"start":197.61,"end":197.91,"text":"Why?","words":[["Why?",197.61,197.91]]},{"start":198.45,"end":202.89,"text":"Well, last time we sent all those email surveys to commercial organizations,","words":[["Well,",198.45,198.75],["last",199.23,199.57],["time",199.57,199.83],["we",199.83,199.97],["sent",199.97,200.19],["all",200.19,200.41],["those",200.41,200.57],["email",200.57,200.89],["surveys",200.89,201.43],["to",201.43,201.65],["commercial",201.65,202.05],["organizations,",202.05,202.89]]},{"start":203.23,"end":206.21,"text":"and we only had replies from 5% of them.","words":[["and",203.23,203.71],["we",203.71,203.85],["only",203.85,204.07],["had",204.07,204.25],["replies",204.25,204.67],["from",204.67,204.93],["5",204.93,205.35],["%",205.35,205.73],["of",205.73,206.03],["them.",206.03,206.21]]},{"start":206.57,"end":207.75,"text":"Oh, I forgot that.","words":[["Oh,",206.57,206.87],["I",206.99,207.11],["forgot",207.11,207.35],["that.",207.35,207.75]]},{"start":208.35,"end":209.09,"text":"Okay, then.","words":[["Okay,",208.35,208.79],["then.",208.95,209.09]]},{"start":209.63,"end":213.37,"text":"What about the other students and the lecturers here in the university?","words":[["What",209.63,209.77],["about",209.77,209.99],["the",209.99,210.21],["other",210.21,210.51],["students",210.51,211.01],["and",211.01,211.53],["the",211.53,211.69],["lecturers",211.69,212.23],["here",212.23,212.61],["in",212.61,212.81],["the",212.81,212.91],["university?",212.91,213.37]]},{"start":213.79,"end":215.67,"text":"You know what the lecturers are like.","words":[["You",213.79,214.37],["know",214.37,214.55],["what",214.55,214.73],["the",214.73,214.89],["lecturers",214.89,215.25],["are",215.25,215.45],["like.",215.45,215.67]]},{"start":216.21,"end":218.01,"text":"They're so busy they won't have the time.","words":[["They're",216.21,216.47],["so",216.47,216.65],["busy",216.65,216.99],["they",216.99,217.17],["won't",217.17,217.31],["have",217.31,217.47],["the",217.47,217.59],["time.",217.59,218.01]]},{"start":218.19,"end":219.57,"text":"But the students will, I'm sure.","words":[["But",218.19,218.45],["the",218.45,218.57],["students",218.57,218.91],["will,",218.91,219.17],["I'm",219.25,219.33],["sure.",219.33,219.57]]},{"start":220.01,"end":220.41,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",220.01,220.41]]},{"start":221.07,"end":224.99,"text":"And as well as that, we could target the local schools like last time.","words":[["And",221.07,221.41],["as",221.41,221.53],["well",221.53,221.71],["as",221.71,221.87],["that,",221.87,222.09],["we",222.29,222.39],["could",222.39,222.75],["target",222.75,223.13],["the",223.13,223.31],["local",223.31,223.59],["schools",223.59,224.05],["like",224.05,224.35],["last",224.35,224.65],["time.",224.65,224.99]]},{"start":224.99,"end":227.17,"text":"School kids just love doing surveys.","words":[["School",224.99,225.59],["kids",225.59,225.83],["just",225.83,226.07],["love",226.07,226.37],["doing",226.37,226.71],["surveys.",226.71,227.17]]},{"start":227.83,"end":230.49,"text":"I think we want to stick to adults for this, don't you?","words":[["I",227.83,228.07],["think",228.07,228.39],["we",228.39,228.59],["want",228.59,228.77],["to",228.77,228.93],["stick",228.93,229.13],["to",229.13,229.27],["adults",229.27,229.63],["for",229.63,229.89],["this,",229.89,230.09],["don't",230.17,230.27],["you?",230.27,230.49]]},{"start":230.95,"end":232.13,"text":"You're probably right.","words":[["You're",230.95,231.19],["probably",231.19,231.61],["right.",231.61,232.13]]},{"start":232.87,"end":236.43,"text":"Maybe we could approach people who rent their own properties around here,","words":[["Maybe",232.87,233.21],["we",233.21,233.43],["could",233.43,233.55],["approach",233.55,233.89],["people",233.89,234.29],["who",234.29,234.51],["rent",234.51,234.87],["their",234.87,235.09],["own",235.09,235.29],["properties",235.29,235.77],["around",235.77,236.09],["here,",236.09,236.43]]},{"start":236.53,"end":238.83,"text":"since they're the ones who have to pay for the energy.","words":[["since",236.53,236.87],["they're",236.87,237.21],["the",237.21,237.31],["ones",237.31,237.53],["who",237.53,237.73],["have",237.73,237.87],["to",237.87,237.99],["pay",237.99,238.21],["for",238.21,238.35],["the",238.35,238.47],["energy.",238.47,238.83]]},{"start":239.23,"end":239.65,"text":"Exactly.","words":[["Exactly.",239.23,239.65]]},{"start":243.12,"end":245.16,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion,","words":[["Before",243.12,243.48],["you",243.48,243.78],["hear",243.78,243.98],["the",243.98,244.16],["rest",244.16,244.42],["of",244.42,244.56],["the",244.56,244.66],["discussion,",244.66,245.16]]},{"start":245.88,"end":250.9,"text":"you have some time to look at questions 26 to 30 on page 6.","words":[["you",245.88,246.06],["have",246.06,246.24],["some",246.24,246.44],["time",246.44,246.78],["to",246.78,246.98],["look",246.98,247.12],["at",247.12,247.26],["questions",247.26,247.6],["26",247.6,248.56],["to",248.56,248.82],["30",248.82,249.28],["on",249.28,250.12],["page",250.12,250.4],["6.",250.4,250.9]]},{"start":286.08,"end":290.04,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 26 to 30.","words":[["Now",286.08,286.4],["listen",286.4,286.78],["and",286.78,287.58],["answer",287.58,288.02],["questions",288.02,288.42],["26",288.42,289.42],["to",289.42,289.66],["30.",289.66,290.04]]},{"start":294.52,"end":297.92,"text":"What about the kind of questions we want to include in the survey?","words":[["What",294.52,295.0],["about",295.0,295.34],["the",295.34,295.54],["kind",295.54,295.86],["of",295.86,296.04],["questions",296.04,296.42],["we",296.42,296.74],["want",296.74,296.88],["to",296.88,297.0],["include",297.0,297.34],["in",297.34,297.5],["the",297.5,297.6],["survey?",297.6,297.92]]},{"start":298.4,"end":302.56,"text":"Well, we need to find out if they know what renewable energy is","words":[["Well,",298.4,298.74],["we",299.06,299.34],["need",299.34,299.62],["to",299.62,299.84],["find",299.84,300.18],["out",300.18,300.42],["if",300.42,300.6],["they",300.6,300.7],["know",300.7,300.9],["what",300.9,301.18],["renewable",301.18,301.58],["energy",301.58,302.08],["is",302.08,302.56]]},{"start":302.56,"end":305.06,"text":"and how familiar people are with the concept.","words":[["and",302.56,303.08],["how",303.08,303.28],["familiar",303.28,303.62],["people",303.62,304.06],["are",304.06,304.32],["with",304.32,304.48],["the",304.48,304.58],["concept.",304.58,305.06]]},{"start":305.74,"end":307.68,"text":"I know it's been all over the news lately,","words":[["I",305.74,305.98],["know",305.98,306.14],["it's",306.14,306.34],["been",306.34,306.5],["all",306.5,306.7],["over",306.7,306.94],["the",306.94,307.06],["news",307.06,307.3],["lately,",307.3,307.68]]},{"start":307.9,"end":310.74,"text":"but I think a lot of people are still in the dark about it.","words":[["but",307.9,308.14],["I",308.14,308.32],["think",308.32,308.54],["a",308.54,308.72],["lot",308.72,308.86],["of",308.86,309.0],["people",309.0,309.24],["are",309.24,309.44],["still",309.44,309.7],["in",309.7,309.86],["the",309.86,309.94],["dark",309.94,310.22],["about",310.22,310.52],["it.",310.52,310.74]]},{"start":311.08,"end":313.7,"text":"Do you think so? I'm not sure I agree.","words":[["Do",311.08,311.26],["you",311.26,311.4],["think",311.4,311.56],["so?",311.56,311.84],["I'm",312.48,312.7],["not",312.7,312.86],["sure",312.86,313.12],["I",313.12,313.36],["agree.",313.36,313.7]]},{"start":314.52,"end":316.24,"text":"But we can have that in if you want.","words":[["But",314.52,314.82],["we",314.82,315.14],["can",315.14,315.28],["have",315.28,315.46],["that",315.46,315.64],["in",315.64,315.78],["if",315.78,315.94],["you",315.94,316.02],["want.",316.02,316.24]]},{"start":316.9,"end":321.7,"text":"We also need to find out what they think about the use of traditional energy sources","words":[["We",316.9,317.38],["also",317.38,317.7],["need",317.7,317.94],["to",317.94,318.14],["find",318.14,318.34],["out",318.34,318.54],["what",318.54,318.76],["they",318.76,319.02],["think",319.02,319.4],["about",319.4,319.66],["the",319.66,319.84],["use",319.84,320.12],["of",320.12,320.3],["traditional",320.3,320.76],["energy",320.76,321.22],["sources",321.22,321.7]]},{"start":321.7,"end":327.34,"text":"like gas and coal, and if they know what effect these types of energy have on their environment.","words":[["like",321.7,322.1],["gas",322.1,322.54],["and",322.54,322.76],["coal,",322.76,323.16],["and",323.52,323.88],["if",323.88,324.02],["they",324.02,324.14],["know",324.14,324.3],["what",324.3,324.54],["effect",324.54,324.9],["these",324.9,325.22],["types",325.22,325.62],["of",325.62,325.82],["energy",325.82,326.12],["have",326.12,326.42],["on",326.42,326.6],["their",326.6,326.78],["environment.",326.78,327.34]]},{"start":327.78,"end":328.96,"text":"And what they cost?","words":[["And",327.78,328.14],["what",328.14,328.38],["they",328.38,328.54],["cost?",328.54,328.96]]},{"start":329.32,"end":336.38,"text":"That's not so important, but we ought to see what they think is going to happen to the consumption of traditional energy sources.","words":[["That's",329.32,329.7],["not",329.7,329.92],["so",329.92,330.16],["important,",330.16,330.66],["but",331.16,331.52],["we",331.52,331.7],["ought",331.7,331.96],["to",331.96,332.12],["see",332.12,332.26],["what",332.26,332.46],["they",332.46,332.64],["think",332.64,332.88],["is",332.88,333.04],["going",333.04,333.2],["to",333.2,333.34],["happen",333.34,333.8],["to",333.8,334.1],["the",334.1,334.22],["consumption",334.22,334.72],["of",334.72,335.0],["traditional",335.0,335.42],["energy",335.42,335.82],["sources.",335.82,336.38]]},{"start":336.94,"end":341.44,"text":"You're right. Then there's nuclear power, and that's an interesting one,","words":[["You're",336.94,337.54],["right.",337.54,337.76],["Then",338.62,338.94],["there's",338.94,339.24],["nuclear",339.24,339.54],["power,",339.54,340.04],["and",340.38,340.48],["that's",340.48,340.66],["an",340.66,340.74],["interesting",340.74,341.1],["one,",341.1,341.44]]},{"start":341.88,"end":348.12,"text":"because it's cleaner and more efficient in many ways than other fuels, but the safety factor has always worried people.","words":[["because",341.88,342.16],["it's",342.16,342.42],["cleaner",342.42,342.84],["and",342.84,343.1],["more",343.1,343.24],["efficient",343.24,343.64],["in",343.64,343.88],["many",343.88,344.04],["ways",344.04,344.4],["than",344.4,344.54],["other",344.54,344.72],["fuels,",344.72,345.08],["but",345.62,345.88],["the",345.88,346.04],["safety",346.04,346.44],["factor",346.44,346.9],["has",346.9,347.16],["always",347.16,347.48],["worried",347.48,347.76],["people.",347.76,348.12]]},{"start":348.5,"end":348.88,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",348.5,348.88]]},{"start":348.88,"end":354.34,"text":"I know that the technology has improved greatly since it was first used, but I don't think","words":[["I",348.88,349.62],["know",349.62,349.8],["that",349.8,349.94],["the",349.94,350.04],["technology",350.04,350.56],["has",350.56,350.8],["improved",350.8,351.18],["greatly",351.18,351.66],["since",351.66,351.92],["it",351.92,352.06],["was",352.06,352.16],["first",352.16,352.4],["used,",352.4,352.78],["but",353.38,353.66],["I",353.66,353.96],["don't",353.96,354.12],["think",354.12,354.34]]},{"start":354.34,"end":355.36,"text":"everyone is convinced.","words":[["everyone",354.34,354.72],["is",354.72,354.92],["convinced.",354.92,355.36]]},{"start":355.82,"end":358.04,"text":"Are there any problems with renewable energy?","words":[["Are",355.82,356.06],["there",356.06,356.24],["any",356.24,356.42],["problems",356.42,356.88],["with",356.88,357.2],["renewable",357.2,357.52],["energy?",357.52,358.04]]},{"start":358.62,"end":358.94,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",358.62,358.94]]},{"start":359.72,"end":362.12,"text":"And we need to know what people think about them.","words":[["And",359.72,360.12],["we",360.12,360.38],["need",360.38,360.54],["to",360.54,360.7],["know",360.7,360.84],["what",360.84,360.98],["people",360.98,361.26],["think",361.26,361.62],["about",361.62,361.86],["them.",361.86,362.12]]},{"start":362.8,"end":367.82,"text":"One argument is that it's going to be too expensive to use solar or wind power.","words":[["One",362.8,363.18],["argument",363.18,363.48],["is",363.48,363.82],["that",363.82,364.28],["it's",364.28,364.44],["going",364.44,364.6],["to",364.6,364.76],["be",364.76,364.9],["too",364.9,365.16],["expensive",365.16,365.78],["to",365.78,366.14],["use",366.14,366.48],["solar",366.48,366.92],["or",366.92,367.18],["wind",367.18,367.44],["power.",367.44,367.82]]},{"start":368.12,"end":373.38,"text":"But once people realize the benefits to us all, the price is bound to come down.","words":[["But",368.12,368.4],["once",368.4,368.96],["people",368.96,369.38],["realize",369.38,369.94],["the",369.94,370.18],["benefits",370.18,370.56],["to",370.56,370.84],["us",370.84,371.0],["all,",371.0,371.34],["the",371.7,371.92],["price",371.92,372.2],["is",372.2,372.38],["bound",372.38,372.66],["to",372.66,372.86],["come",372.86,373.04],["down.",373.04,373.38]]},{"start":373.76,"end":375.74,"text":"It's always expensive to start with.","words":[["It's",373.76,374.04],["always",374.04,374.28],["expensive",374.28,374.94],["to",374.94,375.12],["start",375.12,375.44],["with.",375.44,375.74]]},{"start":375.74,"end":379.28,"text":"Once enough people want it, it'll be a viable prospect.","words":[["Once",375.74,376.54],["enough",376.54,376.86],["people",376.86,377.2],["want",377.2,377.52],["it,",377.52,377.72],["it'll",377.88,378.1],["be",378.1,378.22],["a",378.22,378.36],["viable",378.36,378.7],["prospect.",378.7,379.28]]},{"start":379.64,"end":383.32,"text":"That's true. But the other thing is they don't like it.","words":[["That's",379.64,380.08],["true.",380.08,380.32],["But",380.98,381.24],["the",381.24,381.72],["other",381.72,381.92],["thing",381.92,382.14],["is",382.14,382.34],["they",382.34,382.48],["don't",382.48,382.72],["like",382.72,383.04],["it.",383.04,383.32]]},{"start":383.82,"end":388.3,"text":"They say that some of the technology is ugly, like the big windmills used.","words":[["They",383.82,384.08],["say",384.08,384.28],["that",384.28,384.44],["some",384.44,384.74],["of",384.74,384.86],["the",384.86,384.96],["technology",384.96,385.46],["is",385.46,385.72],["ugly,",385.72,386.06],["like",386.36,387.02],["the",387.02,387.28],["big",387.28,387.48],["windmills",387.48,387.9],["used.",387.9,388.3]]},{"start":388.88,"end":392.22,"text":"A lot of people think they spoil the countryside, and I agree.","words":[["A",388.88,389.02],["lot",389.02,389.08],["of",389.08,389.2],["people",389.2,389.42],["think",389.42,389.72],["they",389.72,389.9],["spoil",389.9,390.26],["the",390.26,390.44],["countryside,",390.44,391.0],["and",391.5,391.82],["I",391.82,391.94],["agree.",391.94,392.22]]},{"start":392.6,"end":395.48,"text":"They're not that bad. They're pretty efficient.","words":[["They're",392.6,392.84],["not",392.84,393.06],["that",393.06,393.36],["bad.",393.36,393.86],["They're",394.48,394.76],["pretty",394.76,394.96],["efficient.",394.96,395.48]]},{"start":395.66,"end":398.76,"text":"So perhaps it's a case of choosing the right place for them,","words":[["So",395.66,395.88],["perhaps",395.88,396.3],["it's",396.3,396.74],["a",396.74,396.84],["case",396.84,397.0],["of",397.0,397.18],["choosing",397.18,397.44],["the",397.44,397.68],["right",397.68,397.88],["place",397.88,398.22],["for",398.22,398.5],["them,",398.5,398.76]]},{"start":398.86,"end":400.48,"text":"where they look leased out of place.","words":[["where",398.86,399.16],["they",399.16,399.4],["look",399.4,399.62],["leased",399.62,399.9],["out",399.9,400.1],["of",400.1,400.2],["place.",400.2,400.48]]},{"start":400.92,"end":405.02,"text":"A good point. It'll be very interesting to see the results of this survey.","words":[["A",400.92,401.06],["good",401.06,401.14],["point.",401.14,401.4],["It'll",402.36,402.84],["be",402.84,402.92],["very",402.92,403.12],["interesting",403.12,403.6],["to",403.6,403.8],["see",403.8,403.94],["the",403.94,404.06],["results",404.06,404.42],["of",404.42,404.6],["this",404.6,404.76],["survey.",404.76,405.02]]},{"start":408.38,"end":414.46,"text":"That is the end of section 3. You now have half a minute to check your answers.","words":[["That",408.38,409.22],["is",409.22,409.38],["the",409.38,409.52],["end",409.52,409.74],["of",409.74,409.86],["section",409.86,410.14],["3.",410.14,410.64],["You",411.48,411.62],["now",411.62,411.9],["have",411.9,412.2],["half",412.2,412.54],["a",412.54,412.76],["minute",412.76,412.98],["to",412.98,413.44],["check",413.44,413.76],["your",413.76,414.06],["answers.",414.06,414.46]]}]}